ALAMO_BENCH 2
# bm2 test recipe (alamo_game_bench_scenario, bench_scenario_check.cmake): alamo_game --bench-make reads it, runs the
# saveload smoke's battle save and writes the full scenario over a copy of it.
name battle_orbit
description bm2 test: the saveload smoke's battle save, 60 fixed-frames ticks, the camera half way round the start view
ticks 60
host game
mode fixed
preset bm-smoke
frames_per_tick 2
camera_anchor start
camera 0 0 0 0 0 35 900
camera 60 0 0 0 180 20 600 60
